This repository contains a cascade configuration, its calibration record and evaluation results. It contains no
model weights. At run time the cascade downloads, from their own repositories at pinned revisions:
  - chaoliangUNSW/Jev-Style-2B-Decision-v3 (Apache-2.0), a fine-tune of Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B
    (Copyright 2026 Alibaba Cloud, Apache-2.0);
  - alibiserikbay/JevK5-9B (Apache-2.0), run through allebee/jevk5 (Apache-2.0), which is installed separately.
Per its model card, part of JevK5-9B's training labels were generated by OpenAI's GPT-6 Luna and are subject to
OpenAI's terms.

validation/jevbench/ holds per-item results on the JevBench public items (github.com/fstandhartinger/jevbench);
validation/decision_index_0.2.1_offline_forecast.scores.json is a score file produced with the Decision Index kit
(github.com/apolinario/decision-index) from public per-row results.

Not affiliated with, endorsed by or connected to TypeSafe or Jev, the JevK5 author, or Alibaba Cloud / the Qwen
team. "Jev-style" only describes the kind of model.
